> HEAD /proxy?url=http://127.0.0.1:<plain-port>/ok
> Origin: https://test.example.com
> X-Proxy-Token: <token>

< 200
< Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type, X-Proxy-Token, X-Target-Authorization, X-Target-Origin
< Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD, POST, OPTIONS
< Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://test.example.com
< Access-Control-Allow-Private-Network: true
< Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Alt-Svc, Cache-Control, Content-Type, Date, Link, Server, Set-Cookie, X-Custom, X-Upstream-Content-Encoding, X-Upstream-Content-Length, X-Upstream-Final-URL, X-Upstream-IP, X-Upstream-Location, X-Upstream-Protocol, X-Upstream-Redirects, X-Upstream-Timing, X-Upstream-Truncated
< Access-Control-Max-Age: 600
< Alt-Svc: h3=":443"; ma=86400
< Cache-Control: max-age=60
< Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
< Date: <date>
< Link: </style.css>; rel=preload; as=style
< Server: golden-target
< Set-Cookie: a=1; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 01 Jan 2031 00:00:00 GMT
< Set-Cookie: b=2; Path=/; HttpOnly
< Vary: Origin
< Vary: X-Target-Authorization
< X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
< X-Custom: hello
< X-Upstream-Ip: 127.0.0.1
< X-Upstream-Protocol: HTTP/1.1
< X-Upstream-Timing: dns=<ms>;tcp=<ms>;ssl=<ms>;ttfb=<ms>;total=<ms>

